From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rustiqly <rustiqly@example.net>
Date: Wed, 13 May 2026 18:44:53 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 07/10] [platform] Restore Celestica platform API wheels

Signed-off-by: Rustiqly <rustiqly@example.net>

Cherry-picked unchanged from sonic-net/sonic-buildimage#27355 (open, base
master), head 748ad3bb4c40017054394affadcc638fdd347fcb, onto 202511: the upstream fix for
sonic-net/sonic-buildimage#27291 (a 202511 DX010's pmon finds no
platform API: no fans, PSUs or temperatures), taken as submitted so this
image tests what upstream is reviewing.
